sing home area is free from accident hazards and provides adequate supervision to prevent accidents.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0602":{"code":"F-0602","title":"Protect each resident from the wrongful use of the resident's belongings or money.","category":"Freedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0628":{"code":"F-0628","title":"Provide the required documentation or notification related to the resident's needs, appeal rights, or bed-hold policies.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-e0022":{"code":"E-0022","title":"Establish policies and procedures for sheltering.","category":"Emergency Preparedness Deficiencies","concept":"emergency_preparedness","concept_label":"Emergency preparedness"},"cms-f0727":{"code":"F-0727","title":"Have a registered nurse on duty 8 hours a day; and  select a registered nurse to be the director of nurses on a full time basis.","category":"Nursing and Physician Services Deficiencies","concept":"staffing","concept_label":"Staffing & supervision"},"cms-f0812":{"code":"F-0812","title":"Procure food from sources approved or considered satisfactory and store, prepare, distribute and serve food in accordance with professional standards.","category":"Nutrition and Dietary Deficiencies","concept":"food_nutrition","concept_label":"Food, nutrition & hydration"},"cms-f0847":{"code":"F-0847","title":"Inform resident or representatives choice to enter into binding arbitration agreement and right to refuse.","category":"Administration Deficiencies","concept":"administration","concept_label":"Administration & records"},"cms-f0558":{"code":"F-0558","title":"Reasonably accommodate the needs and preferences of each resident.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"re